[Options]

[A.]
<h2>The_Test</h2>
<i>"When tested, battle not as you usually battle for the person who is testing usually does it out of fear of the unknown"<br>
--Killdead the Great Prophet of Nimbus</i>  
<p>You have allied with King Dom so Kilrathi went to the Furies for aid and they sent him with one of their servants to test your strength and cunning they said to leave you alive but Kilrathi has his own plans.....

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have defeated Kilrathi and his hired help but Kilrathi's friends are coming to his aid!
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,The_Great_War

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>Message from Kilrathi</h2>
<p>
Your friend's blood has been spilt on the altar and you are next

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>Message from King Dom</h2>
<p>
Please help me they have destroyed my temple HELP!!!!!!!!!


[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You and your ally have been crushed but Kilrathi did not get off scot free when his hired help found out he had killed you he was banished from Nimbus forever! 
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]
